					}
				}
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -3.5d
			y: -0.75d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Earned and Spent"
			description: [
				"&2The primary form of currency for the Game Server is called Vault Coins! "
				""
				"&2Every coin of Scrypto is a piece of cryptocurrency that the server tracks for your safety."
				""
				"&2Scrypto Coins are only useable in the Game Server! They are used to purchase DLC from the shop, and some of our in-world vendors accept them as well!"
				""
				"&2There are four tiers of Scrypto Coins - Copper, Silver, Gold, and Lunevar. Bankers, located on higher ranked Game Server Worlds, exchange coins to a higher tier at 20:1 ratio! That is, for example, 20 Copper Coins to 1 Silver Coin."
			]
			dependencies: ["6D986E5817BEF5A1"]
			hide: true
			id: "05F4CBBD146B0DBB"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1163E6E066AE8F3C"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Currencies of the Game"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -3.5d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Fight For Fun!"
			description: [
				"&2Scrypto is easy to earn! There are multiple approved methods of earning Scrypto within the Game Server."
				""
				"&2The primary way all users can earn Scrypto is via combat mechanics! Fighting the various creatures, monsters, and NPCs in the world can earn you Scrypto!"
				""
				"&2The second approved method of earning Scrypto is by finding one of many APPROVED vendors within the Game Server! They offer many items, and to purchase some items for Scrypto!"
				""
				"&2The final approved method, and easiest, is to procure resources and materials, and DIGITALIZE them!"
				""
				"&4&lALL OTHER METHODS ARE UNAUTHORIZED. AVOID FOR YOUR SAFETY!"
			]
			dependencies: ["05F4CBBD146B0DBB"]
			hide: true
			id: "22810A844797AC73"
			tasks: [{
				id: "277A1582F878E08F"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Earning Scrypto"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Digitalization"
			x: -3.5d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Sell Almost Anything!"
			description: [
				"&2If the combat system of the Game Server is not to your liking, or you just want a break from it, then why not Digitalize the stuff you've collected?"
				""
				"&2Take all that equipment, resources, machines, and more that you've made and let collect dust, and combine it with our patented Digitalizer! "
				""
				"&4NOTE : Not all items are valid for Digitalization. Terms/conditions apply."
				""
				"&2By combining our Digitalizer with, for example, a Block of Iron, you will turn it into a bag of Digitalized Items! How many of these you get depends on how valuable the item you Digitalize is!"
				""
				"&2Then, to sell us the Digitalized Items, all you need to do is combine NINE bags in any crafting table! Our system will detect this, and give you a Copper Scrypto Coin in return!"
				""
				"&2PLEASE INSERT 1,000 &dWrong. One sec... &4ERROR &21 COPPER SCRYPTO PAYMENT."
			]
			dependencies: ["22810A844797AC73"]
			hide: true
			id: "1363CB79C9B54E49"
			tasks: [{
				id: "20022A2037551A06"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:copper_coin"
				consume_items: true
			}]
			rewards: [{
