				item: "kubejs:fop_digitalizer"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -3.5d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Don't forget your DLC!"
			description: [
				"&2Now that you are up to speed and know how to earn money, new Power User, the rest of the DLC Store is open to you!"
				""
				"&2In a survey of the last 10,000 Power Users, 88% agreed that the fastest way to earn Scrypto was by making and selling items! Gathering resources is...."
				""
				"&dPfff, okay enough of their spiel, Bandit. You can see the grift now, right?"
				""
				"&dCombat pays pennies. Well, pennies compared to their Digitalization system. Even that is crazy on how much it gouges you..."
				""
				"&dThough, it might not be much faster to help us break the system open either, not if you need something specific that's locked behind DLC."
				""
				"&dPick and choose your battles, of course. We understand fully the tough spot you are in."
			]
